WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.701
-Hello, everyone,

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:02.702
and welcome back to the attic.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.136
A lotta you have commented

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.705
on the length
of my hair recently

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.206
and some of you have gone so far

00:00:07.206 --> 00:00:08.908
as to tweet that,
with my hair this long,

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:10.910
I look like a less attractive

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:13.479
Josh Meyers and, to those
people, I just wanna say --

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:15.315
Mom, when did you get
on Twitter?

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:17.951
But, rest assured, as soon
as I can get a haircut, I will.

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:20.419
Or, maybe, just maybe,
I'll let it keep growing

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:22.188
and get a job
as one of Trump's doctors.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.724
And, speaking of Trump's
doctors, they're bad,

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.126
because they either gave
the president hydroxychloroquine

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:29.729
or he's lying about taking it
and, honestly,

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.564
I'm not sure
which is more psychotic.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.900
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.670
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:38.938
President Trump
is overseeing one

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:40.806
of the worst cataclysms
in American history

00:00:40.806 --> 00:00:44.244
and part of reason for that is
he's less focused on prevention

00:00:44.244 --> 00:00:45.578
and more focused

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.814
on pushing shortcuts
and unproven miracle cures,

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:51.951
which, his own medical advisers
have repeatedly pushed back on.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:56.422
-Deborah, have you ever heard
of the heat and the light,

00:00:56.422 --> 00:01:01.160
relative to certain viruses,
yes, but relative to this virus?

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.562
-Not as a treatment.

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:04.597
-You take a solid flu vaccine,

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.131
you don't think
that would have an impact

00:01:06.131 --> 00:01:08.133
or much of an impact on corona?

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.569
-No.
-No.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.405
-[ As Trump ]
Okay, but what if you
take a battery --

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.874
say, I don't know, a six-volt --

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:17.310
and you cover it
with Pepto-Bismol

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.812
and maybe like put it
under your pillow overnight,

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:21.047
would that work?

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.049
Okay. Shaking your head no
on that one.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.351
