who finds it is immune?

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.057
Is that possible?

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:32.225
Okay.
You know what?

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:33.625
I can't tell if you're
shaking your head no

00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:35.394
or shaking your head yes.

00:01:35.394 --> 00:01:36.496
It's back and forth.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:37.597
Which one is it?
You know what?

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.865
I think why don't we
just offline this?

00:01:39.865 --> 00:01:41.200
Because the modern
conservative movement

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.302
is largely a haven for hucksters
and con artists,

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:44.871
it makes sense
that they fell for a guy

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.039
