the water, the wine,

00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:52.812
the ties, the magazine,

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.447
the Trump Foundation,
the Trump Institute,

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:55.915
the Trump Network,
Trump University,

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.916
Trump Mortgage, Trump Dojo,
Trump Airlines,

00:01:57.916 --> 00:01:58.952
