00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:35.941
it sounds like Trump

00:09:35.941 --> 00:09:38.611
might already be feeling
some side effects.

00:09:38.611 --> 00:09:40.313
-Obama knew everything
that was happening.

00:09:40.313 --> 00:09:43.382
I don't think Obama knows
where he, uh,

00:09:43.382 --> 00:09:45.250
you know, is, in a lotta ways.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:46.752
I saw his statements
the other day

00:09:46.752 --> 00:09:48.821
and I think that, frankly,
they weren't very good.

00:09:48.821 --> 00:09:50.255
That's President Obama.

00:09:50.255 --> 00:09:52.824
-Damn, are you swallowing
the hydroxychloroquine,

00:09:52.824 --> 00:09:53.826
or snortin' it?

00:09:53.826 --> 00:09:54.826
[ As Trump ]
Come on, man!

00:09:54.826 --> 00:09:56.428
Let me get my drox on!

00:09:56.428 --> 00:09:57.897
Daddy's gotta ride the quine.

00:09:57.897 --> 00:09:58.898
[ Snorting ]

00:09:58.898 --> 00:10:00.332
Hail, Hydra!

00:10:00.332 --> 00:10:01.734
And then, there's the fact

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:03.802
that Trump's relentless
hawking of this product

00:10:03.802 --> 00:10:06.772
has created shortages
for people who need it.

00:10:06.772 --> 00:10:08.607
It's a life-saving drug,

00:10:08.607 --> 00:10:10.276
for people
with conditions like Lupus,

00:10:10.276 --> 00:10:12.845
and they were already struggling
to get hydroxychloroquine,

00:10:12.845 --> 00:10:14.280
due, in part,

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:16.381
to the president hyping it up
as a coronavirus treatment.

00:10:16.381 --> 00:10:18.584
Lupus patients reported
having to ration their pills

00:10:18.584 --> 00:10:21.253
because of the
hydroxychloroquine shortage,

00:10:21.253 --> 00:10:22.621
with one telling USA Today,

00:10:22.621 --> 00:10:24.990
"When I have that medicine,
I can live life normally

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.291
and don't have
to think about it.

00:10:26.291 --> 00:10:27.593
Now, I have to stop and think

00:10:27.593 --> 00:10:30.262
before I even pick up my
toothbrush to brush my teeth,"

00:10:30.262 --> 00:10:31.630
and that's horrifying because,

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.432
if people get distracted
before brushing,

00:10:33.432 --> 00:10:35.066
you'll have to deal
with a second ailment,

00:10:35.066 --> 00:10:36.768
known as Rudy's Teeth.

00:10:36.768 --> 00:10:38.069
Rudy, ugh!

00:10:38.069 --> 00:10:39.938
My God, man, I've never
said this to anyone, but,

00:10:39.938 --> 00:10:42.007
maybe have your teeth removed?

00:10:42.007 --> 00:10:43.242
You might look better
with just gums.

00:10:43.242 --> 00:10:44.410
Seriously, how are
your top teeth

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:45.911
and bottom teeth so different?

00:10:45.911 --> 00:10:48.480
Could you only afford half
a box of Crest Whitestrips?

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.050
Most public health experts
have cautioned

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.984
against the president's
reckless touting

00:10:52.984 --> 00:10:54.586
of hydroxychloroquine,

00:10:54.586 --> 00:10:56.655
like ousted vaccine
Chief Rick Bright,

00:10:56.655 --> 00:10:59.958
who testified last week
that he was punished, in part,

00:10:59.958 --> 00:11:02.228
for questioning Trump's
advertising of the drug.

00:11:02.228 --> 00:11:06.131
-I believe part of the removal
process for me was initiated

00:11:06.131 --> 00:11:09.768
because of a pushback
that I gave

00:11:09.768 --> 00:11:12.270
when they asked me
to put in place

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:16.008
an expanded access protocol
that would make chloroquine

00:11:16.008 --> 00:11:18.310
more freely available
to Americans

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:21.246
that were not under the close
supervision of a physician

00:11:21.246 --> 00:11:22.715
and may not even be confirmed

00:11:22.715 --> 00:11:24.749
to be infected
with the coronavirus.

00:11:24.749 --> 00:11:25.751
-They wanted to give it
to people

00:11:25.751 --> 00:11:27.319
who do not even have
coronavirus.

00:11:27.319 --> 00:11:29.888
You know, when I heard that,
I never thought that last group

00:11:29.888 --> 00:11:31.823
would include the president
of the United States.

00:11:31.823 --> 00:11:33.725
"They asked me
to make chloroquine

00:11:33.725 --> 00:11:35.160
freely available to Americans

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:38.263
that were not under the close
supervision of a doctor,

00:11:38.263 --> 00:11:39.831
may not be infected
with coronavirus,

00:11:39.831 --> 00:11:41.433
and whose symptoms include

00:11:41.433 --> 00:11:42.701
sitting on the edge
of their seat

00:11:42.701 --> 00:11:44.637
like they're trying
to not to take a, um..."

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.142
"...a, um,
tip dip in the tool pool."

00:11:50.142 --> 00:11:51.977
But the hype got started

00:11:51.977 --> 00:11:54.513
with a small French study
of just 20 patients,

00:11:54.513 --> 00:11:56.815
which medical experts
have since called pathetic

00:11:56.815 --> 00:11:58.216
and a complete failure

00:11:58.216 --> 00:12:00.152
and which the publisher
itself has said

00:12:00.152 --> 00:12:01.586
didn't meet its standards.

00:12:01.586 --> 00:12:02.888
The study was co-authored

00:12:02.888 --> 00:12:06.659
by an eccentric French doctor
named Didier Raoult.

00:12:06.659 --> 00:12:08.761
And, before I show you
his photo,

00:12:08.761 --> 00:12:10.996
here is a photo
of Trump's former doctor

00:12:10.996 --> 00:12:12.998
Harold Bornstein.

00:12:12.998 --> 00:12:14.399
Remember him?

00:12:14.399 --> 00:12:19.371
Now, I want you to imagine
what Didier Raoult looks like.

00:12:19.371 --> 00:12:20.806
Are you ready?

00:12:20.806 --> 00:12:22.173
Okay.

00:12:22.173 --> 00:12:23.843
Here he is!
[ Laughing ]

00:12:23.843 --> 00:12:25.711
Mon dieu!

00:12:25.711 --> 00:12:28.947
He's Harold Bornstein's
French cousin.

00:12:28.947 --> 00:12:30.982
[ stoner voice ]
Hey, Didi, wanna come over

00:12:30.982 --> 00:12:32.351
to the States, man?

00:12:32.351 --> 00:12:36.121
I got backstage passes
to the Steely Dan concert.

00:12:36.121 --> 00:12:38.490
[ French accent ]
Hello, American cousin.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:40.192
I wish I could, but I am busy

00:12:40.192 --> 00:12:42.261
attaching electrodes
to a baguette,

00:12:42.261 --> 00:12:43.795
to see if it will talk.

00:12:43.795 --> 00:12:46.665
Seriously, why do all
of Trump's favorite doctors

00:12:46.665 --> 00:12:48.066
look like they found
their medical degree

00:12:48.066 --> 00:12:49.735
in a Porta Potti at Woodstock?

00:12:49.735 --> 00:12:51.002
They look like they went
into quarantine

00:12:51.002 --> 00:12:53.205
during the swine flu
and just never came out.

00:12:53.205 --> 00:12:54.807
[ stoner voice ]
Hey, man, I think --

00:12:54.807 --> 00:12:56.342
Hey, I think it's safe, man.

00:12:56.342 --> 00:12:58.677
Didier!
I think it's safe.

00:12:58.677 --> 00:13:00.479
And, just to give you an idea

00:13:00.479 --> 00:13:02.447
of how psychotic
Trump's comment was,

00:13:02.447 --> 00:13:03.782
doctors and TV anchors

00:13:03.782 --> 00:13:06.051
had to urge viewers not
to follow his lead.

00:13:06.051 --> 00:13:08.320
Even Fox News urged caution.

00:13:08.320 --> 00:13:11.123
-If you are in a risky
population, here,

00:13:11.123 --> 00:13:12.624
and you are taking this

00:13:12.624 --> 00:13:16.195
as a preventative treatment
to ward off the virus

00:13:16.195 --> 00:13:19.365
or, in a worst-case scenario,
you are dealing with the virus

00:13:19.365 --> 00:13:21.867
and you are in this
vulnerable population,

00:13:21.867 --> 00:13:23.202
it will kill you.

00:13:23.202 --> 00:13:27.105
I cannot stress enough --
this will kill you.

00:13:27.105 --> 00:13:29.508
It sounds like
what you're saying,

00:13:29.508 --> 00:13:31.911
you have a risk
of losing your life,

00:13:31.911 --> 00:13:35.180
if you do what the president
just recommended.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.382
-That's correct.
Be very, very careful

00:13:37.382 --> 00:13:39.717
of what you put in your mouth
and what you swallow,

00:13:39.717 --> 00:13:40.986
be it liquid or solid.

00:13:40.986 --> 00:13:42.621
-That's right,
thanks to the president,

00:13:42.621 --> 00:13:45.090
a doctor literally had to go
on TV and tell people,

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.725
"Be careful what you put
in your mouth

00:13:46.725 --> 00:13:48.593
and what you swallow,"
like he was talkin'

00:13:48.593 --> 00:13:50.962
to children playing
with Matchbox cars.

00:13:50.962 --> 00:13:53.632
Donald, where's that toy car
you were just playing with?

00:13:53.632 --> 00:13:56.134
[ As Trump ]
Uh, it went through a tunnel.

00:13:56.134 --> 00:13:59.271
Of course, Fox News
has been loyally parroting

00:13:59.271 --> 00:14:01.940
Trump's hydroxychloroquine
talking points for weeks, now,

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.877
and the surprising show
of dissent from Cavuto

00:14:04.877 --> 00:14:07.145
prompted a characteristically
pissy tweet

00:14:07.145 --> 00:14:08.480
from Trump last night.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:10.048
".@FoxNews
is no longer the same.

00:14:10.048 --> 00:14:12.417
We miss the great Roger Ailes.

00:14:12.417 --> 00:14:15.554
You have more anti-Trump people,
by far, than ever before.

00:14:15.554 --> 00:14:17.289
Looking for a new outlet!"

00:14:17.289 --> 00:14:19.925
Ah, yes, the great Roger Ailes,
the famous creep

00:14:19.925 --> 00:14:21.560
who oversaw a culture
of paranoia

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.928
and sexual harassment
at Fox News

00:14:22.928 --> 00:14:25.697
that led to him getting fired
by liberal snowflake --

00:14:25.697 --> 00:14:27.666
let me see --
Rupert Murdoch.

00:14:27.666 --> 00:14:30.269
The conservative movement
elevated a huckster

00:14:30.269 --> 00:14:32.504
who spent his career
pushing scam products

00:14:32.504 --> 00:14:34.305
and miracle cures
to the presidency

00:14:34.305 --> 00:14:36.942
and, now, he's doing the same
thing with a pandemic

00:14:36.942 --> 00:14:39.677
that has ravaged the country
and cratered the economy.

00:14:39.677 --> 00:14:41.346
Next time people think
about voting for Trump,

00:14:41.346 --> 00:14:44.016
the media might want to warn
them there's a chance...

00:14:44.016 --> 00:14:45.150
-It will kill you.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.818
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

00:14:46.818 --> 00:14:50.555
♪♪

00:14:50.555 --> 00:14:51.824
During the COVID crisis,

00:14:51.824 --> 00:14:53.425
