00:14:53.425 --> 00:14:54.926
to rescue and deliver more food

00:14:54.926 --> 00:14:56.594
to meet the increased need
in New York City.

00:14:56.594 --> 00:14:59.564
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:14:59.564 --> 00:15:02.701
